Kino: lite build tag "kino"

With -tags kino the server is built without the web UI, Swagger, MCP, MSX,
WebDAV, FUSE and the Telegram bot. Kino talks to it over the JSON API
(/echo, /settings, /torrents, /torrent/upload, /stream) only, and the binary
shrinks from about 64 MB to about 22 MB (arm64, with gin's nomsgpack tag).
Without the tag the build is unchanged.

